   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Using the future",
     "texto": [
      "The futur simple talks about something that will happen later or about a prediction: **Un jour, je vivrai à l'étranger** (one day I will live abroad).",
      "To forecast the weather or something likely: **Demain, il fera beau** (tomorrow the weather will be nice)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "If + present, future",
     "texto": [
      "In a condition, use **si** + present and then the future: **S'il fait beau, nous irons à la plage** (if the weather is nice, we will go to the beach). In an indirect question, **si** means «whether» and can be followed by the future: **Je ne sais pas s'il viendra** (I don't know whether he will come)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "If + present, future",
     "columnas": [
